### Recommendation: **{{ recommendation }}**

{% if recommendation == "Go" %}
The project demonstrates strong financial viability under the base-case tariff scenario with an IRR of {{ (financial.project_irr * 100) | num(1) }}% and a subsidy requirement of {{ financial.subsidy_pct_capex }}% of CAPEX. The project is recommended to proceed to full feasibility study and detailed engineering design.
{% elif recommendation == "Conditional Go" %}
The project shows potential viability but requires attention to key conditions before proceeding. {% if financial %}The project IRR of {{ (financial.project_irr * 100) | num(1) }}% under the base case {% if financial.project_irr < 0.08 %}is below the 8% threshold for unconditional recommendation{% endif %}.{% endif %} A full feasibility study should address the conditions identified in Section 15.
{% elif recommendation == "Redesign" %}
The current system configuration does not meet minimum financial viability thresholds. However, the underlying demand fundamentals support consideration of an alternative design. See Section 15 for redesign recommendations.
{% elif recommendation == "No-Go" %}
